{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16622","headline":"忆长安 十二月 · 谢良辅","name":"忆长安 十二月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆长安，腊月时，温泉彩仗新移。\n瑞气遥迎凤辇，日光先暖龙池。\n取酒虾蟇陵下，家家守岁传巵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谢良辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}